# MCP config with local paths - never commit
.mcp.json

# LIVE CREDENTIALS - never commit. The OAuth setup scripts
# (gates/_gmail_oauth_setup.py, gates/_calendar_oauth_setup.py) read this
# as their INPUT (the downloaded Google OAuth client file); the runtime
# primitives read env vars or the pass store, never this file. It was
# found un-ignored (and mis-documented as gitignored) 2026-08-17 - a
# single `git add .` would have committed real Google client secrets +
# refresh tokens, a Telegram bot token, a WhatsApp API token and a
# Discord bot token.
config/credentials.json
